      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2031,
      "text": "We gave Moses the Scripture and made it a guide for the Children of Israel, “Do not take besides Me anyone as a Disposer of Affairs[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 282,
      "ruku": 240,
      "hizbQuarter": 113,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2032,
      "text": "O descendants of those whom We carried [on board] with Noah[2]. He was indeed a grateful slave.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
